# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day 04

## Topic
# Present Perfect + have been vs. have gone

---

## Rule

### have been to + 장소

→ ~에 가본 적이 있다. (다녀와서 현재 여기 있음)

Examples

- I have been to Japan twice.
- She has been to Canada before.
- Have you ever been to Paris?

---

### have gone to + 장소

→ ~에 갔다. (아직 그곳에 있음)

Examples

- Tom has gone to the library.
- My parents have gone to Busan.

---

## Remember

| have been to | have gone to |
|---------------|--------------|
| 다녀온 경험 | 지금 그곳에 있음 |
| 경험 | 현재 부재 |

---

## TOEIC Tip

- **Have you ever been to ~?** → 경험 묻기
- **has gone to ~** → 아직 돌아오지 않음
